What should I do if my X10 Pro Omni T2351 reports a warning 6010:Clean water tank not in place, please check, The clean water tank is not in place?
1. Please put the clean water tank back at the station correctly.
2. If the clean water tank has been installed correctly and there is still an error, please check whether the magnet at the bottom of the clean water tank is still there;

What should I do if my X10 Pro Omni T2351 machine makes cleaning noise,runs louder,is running with a loud noise?
1. The noise from the machine may come from the fan, roller brush, side brush, side wheel, or mop pads;
2. If the fan noise is very sharp, remove the dust box, take out the filter, and check if the filter is severely clogged. Clean the filter and try again;
